flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T20:11:42.9034473Z This installation tool will set up your computer with the Nix package
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T20:11:42.9035218Z manager. This will happen in a few stages:
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T20:11:42.9035476Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T20:11:42.9036717Z 1. Make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix. If it does, I
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T20:11:42.9037545Z    will show you instructions on how to clean up your old install.
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T20:11:42.9038358Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T20:11:42.9038678Z 2. Show you what I am going to install and where. Then I will ask
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T20:11:42.9039343Z    if you are ready to continue.
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T20:11:42.9039659Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T20:11:42.9040296Z 3. Create the system users ^[[34m(uids [30001..30008])^[[0m and groups ^[[34m(gid 30000)^[[0m
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T20:11:42.9041207Z    that the Nix daemon uses to run builds. To create system users
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T20:11:42.9041981Z    in a different range, exit and run this tool again with
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T20:11:42.9042576Z    NIX_FIRST_BUILD_UID set.
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T20:11:42.9042852Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T20:11:42.9043197Z 4. Perform the basic installation of the Nix files daemon.
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T20:11:42.9043639Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T20:11:42.9043970Z 5. Configure your shell to import special Nix Profile files, so you
