flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T20:11:42.9044784Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T20:11:42.9044909Z 6. Start the Nix daemon.
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T20:11:42.9045114Z 
