flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T20:11:42.9049763Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T20:11:42.9050118Z  - make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix files
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T20:11:42.9050845Z    (if it does, I will tell you how to clean them up.)
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T20:11:42.9051609Z  - create local users (see the list above for the users I'll make)
